   "provenance": "Data After Dark Social",
   "entity": "venue:Brixton Warehouse Taproom"
  },
  {
   "kind": "venue",
   "text": "Old Street Basement Bar is free with a GBP 500 minimum bar spend; no AV, so bring your own screen and speaker.",
